{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19716","headline":"顺宗至德大圣大安孝皇帝挽歌词三首 二 · 吕温","name":"顺宗至德大圣大安孝皇帝挽歌词三首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"监抚垂三纪，声徽洽万方。\n礼因驰道着，明自垦田彰。\n积渐承鸿业，从容守太康。\n更留园寝诏，恭听有余芳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕温","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19716.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19716","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}